                <mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b&gt;Power Wiring Note:&lt;/b&gt; The Storm32 BGC has two pre-wired power leads (Red and Black) coming out of the bottom of the PCB. The Red wire connects to the output screw terminal of Relay Channel B (screw terminal slot B2). The Black wire connects back directly to the GND WAGO Bus to complete the high-power circuit loop." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#F59E0B;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=11;strokeWidth=1.5;" parent="1" vertex="1">
